        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>Explanation</name>
          <id>270</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Enables importing the chart of accounts that corresponds to the &lt;link template>template&lt;/> from a file in one of the following formats:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) and Microsoft Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Open Document Spreadsheet (.ods)
• Spreadsheet document (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>امکان ورود سرفصل حساب‌های منطبق با &lt;link template>الگو&lt;/> از فایلی در یکی از قالب‌های زیر را فراهم می‌کند:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) و Microsoft Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Open Document Spreadsheet (.ods)
• سند صفحه‌گسترده (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Позволяет загрузить план счетов из файла, соответствующий &lt;link template>шаблону&lt;/>, в одном из форматов:
• Книги Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) и Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Электронные таблицы Open Document (.ods)
• Табличный документ (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Aşağıdaki biçimlerden birinde &lt;link template>şablona&lt;/> karşılık gelen dosyadan hesap planı yüklemenizi sağlar:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) ve Excel 2007 (.xlsx) çalışma kitapları
• Open Document elektronik tabloları (.ods)
• E-tablo belgesi (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Cho phép kết nhập hệ thống tài khoản từ tệp mà tương ứng với &lt;link template>khuôn in&lt;/>, theo một trong số định dạng:
• Sổ Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) và Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Bảng điện tử Open Document (.ods)
• Văn bản dạng bảng (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Enables importing the chart of accounts that corresponds to the &lt;link template>template&lt;/> from a file in one of the following formats:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) and Microsoft Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Open Document Spreadsheet (.ods)
• Spreadsheet document (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Enables importing the chart of accounts that corresponds to the &lt;link template>template&lt;/> from a file in one of the following formats:
• Microsoft Excel 97 (.xls) and Microsoft Excel 2007 (.xlsx)
• Open Document Spreadsheet (.ods)
• Spreadsheet document (.mxl)</value>
          </title>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>ExplanationExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>272</id>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
